  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758872,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Year Duplex: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nStep into the quirky world of *1 Year Duplex* for the Commodore 64, a unique and challenging adventure game unlike any other. You play as a young man who, through a bizarre twist of fate, finds himself trapped within a single apartment building – the Duplex – for an entire year. \n\nThe Duplex isn't just any building; it's a labyrinthine structure filled with eccentric residents, each harboring their own secrets and strange obsessions. Your goal? To unravel the mystery of your imprisonment and escape the Duplex before the year is up. \n\nGameplay revolves around exploration, puzzle-solving, and interacting with the building's inhabitants. Expect to gather clues, complete odd jobs, and navigate a complex social landscape. The game features a charming, pixelated aesthetic and a captivating soundtrack that perfectly complements the surreal atmosphere.  Be prepared for unexpected encounters and a narrative that will keep you guessing until the very end. Can you solve the mystery and break free from the Duplex?"
    },
